      {
        "index": 4,
        "text": "But we all kept optimistic and made a good adjustment to the situation. We swept up the surrounding mud to make our settlement and were back on our feet soon. Finally, guided by the smoke of our crashing jet, some local citizens came by carriages and saved us.",
        "zh": "但大家保持乐观，很好地适应了局面。我们收拢周围的泥土，搭建临时住处，很快重新振作起来。最后，当地人看到了失事飞机冒出的烟，乘马车赶来，救了我们。",
